<title>POLAND: Exbud, Mostostal-W to cooperate.</title>
<headline>Exbud, Mostostal-W to cooperate.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Polish construction companies Exbud SA and Mostostal Warszawa signed a cooperation deal, Mostostal said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The agreement provides for Mostostal and Exbud to offer their services together in tenders for large deals, it said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
